{
    "title": "Real Guitar: acoustic electric",
    "description": "The Real Guitar provides all the tools necessary to master the art of playing guitar on your smartphone or tablet. Now you can easily play any music, anywhere! Feel the sensation of playing guitar in a real band!\r\n\r\nWhat is a guitar?\r\nA guitar is a musical instrument played by plucking or strumming its strings. Guitars come in various types, including acoustic and electric guitars.\r\n\r\nWhy, haven't you learned to play the guitar yet?\r\nReal Guitar offers multiple video lessons to support you, along with a variety of loops for interactive play-along experiences.\r\n\r\nDon't have access to an acoustic or electric guitar? No problem! \r\nReal Guitar provides a diverse range of instruments with high-quality sounds, enabling you to play any song you desire!\r\n\r\nYou don't need a physical guitar to learn to play!\r\nReal Guitar is an ideal choice for practicing or playing the guitar quietly, without causing disturbance or requiring extensive space. Enjoy the freedom to practice guitar anywhere you like!\r\n\r\nShow your friends how good you are at playing guitar!\r\nShare videos of your performances with friends and on social media!\r\n\r\nThe Real Guitar app allows both children and adults to learn the guitar while having fun and enhancing their cognitive and motor skills. This guitar game will stimulate your musical talent, making it easy to learn as if using a real guitar instrument.\r\n\r\nSo, what are you waiting for to become a guitarist?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nExplore the features of Real Guitar:\r\n\r\n- 100 guitar lessons: Learn to play guitar with our lessons.\r\n\r\n- Full 22-Fret Scale: Explore the entire fretboard.\r\n\r\n- Solo and Chord Mode: Switch between playing solos and strumming chords effortlessly.\r\n\r\n- Adjustable Scale Size: Customize the fretboard to your preference.\r\n\r\n- Guitar Chords Library: Access over 1500 chords.\r\n\r\n- Studio Audio Quality: Enjoy crystal-clear sound.\r\n\r\n- A Diverse Range of Instruments: Explore lifelike instrument options.\r\n\r\n- New Instruments Weekly: Keep your sound fresh.\r\n\r\n- Recording Mode: Record your tunes and share them on social media.\r\n\r\n- Interactive Loops: Play along with professionally crafted loops.\r\n\r\n- MIDI Support: Connect your MIDI devices for enhanced control.\r\n\r\n- Universal Compatibility: Works seamlessly on all screen resolutions, from smartphones to tablets (HD images).\r\n\r\n- Free App: No hidden costs.\r\n\r\n- Delay-Free Audio: Enjoy seamless sound.\r\n\r\nTry it out and have fun with the best guitar app on Google Play!\r\nMade for guitarists, professional musicians, amateurs, and beginners alike!\r\nFrom the same creator of Real Drum.\r\n\r\nDon't wait any longer to become a guitarist. Download Real Guitar now!\r\n\r\nStay connected with us on TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, and YouTube for expert tips on how to make the most of the app! Follow us: @kolbapps\r\n\r\nKolb Apps: Touch & Play!\r\n\r\nKeywords: electric guitar, acoustic guitar, chords, electric, acoustic, solo, play, lessons, riff, band, hero, tuner, game, music, learn, rock, kids, learn guitar, guitar for beginners, guitars chords, play guitar, guitar chords for beginners, guitar lessons for beginners, guitar songs, Guitar simulator virtual Guitar, band, heavy metal, pop, reggae, edm, blues, k-pop",
